{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0ltYWdpbmFlcnVtJTIwJTI4MjAxMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Imaginaerum","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/46VRjkR9CeSmnbIY1KGCi13YBWY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4yor13fR3xzwojRFkh9sc5XJMHb.jpg","description":"Imaginaerum tells the story of an elderly composer, Tom, who suffers from severe dementia. As he has had the disease for years and has regressed into childhood, he remembers practically nothing from his adult life. His music, friends, all his past including the memory of his daughter are a blur in his fragile mind. All he has left is the imagination of a ten year old boy. As he drifts away into coma, it seems impossible to get back what he has lost. Or is it?","releaseInfo":"2012","genres":["Fantasy","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.7","runtime":"86 min","cast":["Marianne Farley","Quinn Lord","Francis X. McCarthy","Tuomas Holopainen","Ilkka Villi","Marco Hietala","Anette Olzon","Emppu Vuorinen"],"director":["Stobe Harju"],"released":"2012-11-23T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Marianne Farley","character":"Gem Whitman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b7JAa7GEyWnAyRYRlsRsq5Q5kR4.jpg"},{"name":"Quinn Lord","character":"Tom Whitman (age 10)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aWeDDDxf88l6y1QhOffOcR3IYpf.jpg"},{"name":"Francis X. McCarthy","character":"Tom Whitman (age 70)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4DyZhRmxGrwhr2UNc1CTZHdvZ0R.jpg"},{"name":"Tuomas Holopainen","character":"Tom Whitman (age 47)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uyxgHYCKOdWTjsiVRbikhcdlulp.jpg"},{"name":"Ilkka Villi","character":"Mr. White / Theodore Whitman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vfoQtGiyXpYWZnWSpZDQ0jm3dNo.jpg"},{"name":"Marco Hietala","character":"Marcus","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oLkpDyr6oqc3KImYwfwWsm7k28p.jpg"},{"name":"Anette Olzon","character":"Ann","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org